@@title SQ-RFX Rules fixes P5 on a boot: Creative Common text and American spelling in log and config text, 2026-11-17 ([plan_rules_fixes.md](../plan_rules_fixes.md) 13 and 15b; TODO `conventions #29`, `conventions #32`)
