## SQ-RFX-28 | boot log and freshly written config files carry no patcherMod text (old name) and no British spelling from our jars
@group A (fresh server, no config/ files of the Creative jars, so each is written new)
@commands Boot to the world; `shell` checks of `logs/latest.log` and the written `config/creative*-common.toml` comment lines; `/reload` once and check the log again
